      "cooked": "<p>Mm-mm-mm, ground Maerynian! Powers ya through the day!</p>\n<p>I feel like we need more funny Wager Master snippets like what happened here.</p>\n<p>So you’re telling me Adam’s a secret jock?</p>\n<p>I agree, Inversanimalverse is exhausting, as are those puns. Custardverse, though…</p>\n<p>That sped-up theme song is crazy, it’s so bright and upbeat, in that it makes me realize the usual version is neither of those things and that’s weird. :B</p>",
